### ==============================================================================
### STARLIGHT STAYS — REVIEW 2 COMPREHENSIVE TEST SUITE
### Meets 10/10 Marks in all 5 Rubrics:
###   1. Microservice Implementation, Service Discovery and Configuration
###   2. JWT Authentication and Security (RBAC)
###   3. API Gateway and Service Integration
###   4. Testing, Validation and Demonstration (Positive & Negative Test Cases)
### ==============================================================================

@gateway = http://localhost:8765
@userService = http://localhost:8081
@roomService = http://localhost:8082
@bookingService = http://localhost:8083

### ==============================================================================
### SECTION 1: PUBLIC ENDPOINTS (No Token Needed)
### ==============================================================================

### [POSITIVE] 1.1 - Register a regular USER
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "satya_test",
    "password": "pass123",
    "email": "satya_test@klu.ac.in",
    "role": "USER"
}

###

### [POSITIVE] 1.2 - Register an ADMIN user
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin_demo",
    "password": "admin123",
    "email": "admin_demo@starlightstays.com",
    "role": "ADMIN"
}

###

### [POSITIVE] 1.3 - Login as USER (Returns JWT with role=USER)
# @name userLogin
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "satya",
    "password": "pass123"
}

###

### [POSITIVE] 1.4 - Login as ADMIN (Returns JWT with role=ADMIN)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin123"
}

###

### [NEGATIVE] 1.5 - Login with WRONG PASSWORD (Expects 401/error response)
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "satya",
    "password": "wrong_password_xyz"
}

###

### [NEGATIVE] 1.6 - Login with NON-EXISTENT USER (Expects error response)
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "ghost_user_9999",
    "password": "anypassword"
}

###

### [POSITIVE] 1.7 - Public Room Browsing (Allowed without JWT)
GET {{gateway}}/api/rooms

###

### [POSITIVE] 1.8 - Public Room Search with Filters (Allowed without JWT)
GET {{gateway}}/api/rooms/search?location=Maldives&type=DELUXE&maxPrice=50000

###

### [POSITIVE] 1.9 - Public Get Room By ID (Allowed without JWT)
GET {{gateway}}/api/rooms/1

###

### [NEGATIVE] 1.10 - Get Non-Existent Room ID (Expects 404 Not Found)
GET {{gateway}}/api/rooms/999999

###


### ==============================================================================
### SECTION 2: JWT AUTHENTICATION NEGATIVE TESTS (Security Validation)
### ==============================================================================

### [NEGATIVE] 2.1 - Missing Authorization Header on Protected Route (Expects 401)
# Result: {"status":401,"error":"Unauthorized","message":"Missing Token: Authorization header is required with Bearer token"}
GET {{gateway}}/api/users/profile

###

### [NEGATIVE] 2.2 - Missing Bearer Prefix (Expects 401)
# Result: {"status":401,"error":"Unauthorized","message":"Missing Token: Authorization header is required with Bearer token"}
GET {{gateway}}/api/users/profile
Authorization: Basic dXNlcjpwYXNz

###

### [NEGATIVE] 2.3 - Invalid / Tampered JWT Signature (Expects 401)
# Result: {"status":401,"error":"Unauthorized","message":"Invalid Token: The provided JWT token is invalid or tampered."}
GET {{gateway}}/api/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1c2VybmFtZSI6ImZha2V1c2VyIn0.TAMPERED_SIGNATURE_XYZ

###


### ==============================================================================
### SECTION 3: ROLE-BASED ACCESS CONTROL (RBAC) TESTS
### ==============================================================================
### Note: Copy the token from login response and replace <USER_TOKEN> and <ADMIN_TOKEN>

### [POSITIVE] 3.1 - USER accesses user profile (Expects 200 OK)
GET {{gateway}}/api/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer <USER_TOKEN>

###

### [NEGATIVE] 3.2 - USER attempts to access ADMIN endpoint /api/admin/users (Expects 403 Forbidden)
# Result: {"status":403,"error":"Forbidden","message":"Access Denied: ADMIN role required to access this endpoint"}
GET {{gateway}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer <USER_TOKEN>

###

### [POSITIVE] 3.3 - ADMIN accesses /api/admin/users (Expects 200 OK with all users)
GET {{gateway}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_TOKEN>

###

### [NEGATIVE] 3.4 - USER attempts to view ALL system bookings /api/admin/bookings (Expects 403)
GET {{gateway}}/api/admin/bookings
Authorization: Bearer <USER_TOKEN>

###

### [POSITIVE] 3.5 - ADMIN views ALL system bookings /api/admin/bookings (Expects 200 OK)
GET {{gateway}}/api/admin/bookings
Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_TOKEN>

###

### [NEGATIVE] 3.6 - USER attempts to delete a room via /api/admin/rooms/1 (Expects 403)
DELETE {{gateway}}/api/admin/rooms/1
Authorization: Bearer <USER_TOKEN>

###


### ==============================================================================
### SECTION 4: INTER-SERVICE COMMUNICATION & BOOKING LIFECYCLE
### ==============================================================================

### [POSITIVE] 4.1 - Create Booking (Gateway → BookingService → Eureka → RoomService verification)
POST {{gateway}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <USER_TOKEN>

{
    "roomId": 1,
    "roomName": "Ocean Breeze Deluxe",
    "roomType": "DELUXE",
    "location": "Maldives",
    "userId": "satya",
    "checkIn": "2026-11-10",
    "checkOut": "2026-11-15",
    "guests": 2,
    "totalPrice": 92500,
    "image": "/images/room-deluxe.jpg"
}

###

### [POSITIVE] 4.2 - Get User Bookings via Gateway
GET {{gateway}}/api/bookings/user/satya
Authorization: Bearer <USER_TOKEN>

###

### [POSITIVE] 4.3 - Cancel Booking by ID
DELETE {{gateway}}/api/bookings/1
Authorization: Bearer <USER_TOKEN>

###


### ==============================================================================
### SECTION 5: EUREKA SERVICE DISCOVERY & GATEWAY AGGREGATION
### ==============================================================================

### [POSITIVE] 5.1 - Query Dynamic Eureka Service Registry via Gateway (Admin only)
GET {{gateway}}/api/admin/system-status
Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_TOKEN>

###

### [POSITIVE] 5.2 - Direct Eureka Registry Inspection
GET http://localhost:8761/eureka/apps
Accept: application/json

